// InstallService: the platform-component install surface of ADR-0021, served
// (issue #60). It is `kelson install` at the API plane: the same pins table,
// the same detection-first eligibility, the same preview-confirm-apply shape —
// the confirmation step is the client's (the UI shows the plan and asks), and
